<title>USA: Piedmont Muni Power bonds free to trade 1100 EDT.</title>
<headline>Piedmont Muni Power bonds free to trade 1100 EDT.</headline>
<text>
<p>PIEDMONT MUNICIPAL POWER AGENCY</p>
<p>RE: $163,565,000</p>
<p>(SOUTH CAROLINA)</p>
<p>ELECTRIC REVENUE BONDS</p>
<p>1996A REFUNDING SERIES</p>
<p>Effective at 11:00 A.M. E.D.T., Monday, September 9, 1996</p>
<p>all syndicate terms and price restrictions are removed</p>
<p>and the bonds will be free to trade.</p>
<p>J.P. Morgan Securities Inc.</p>
<p>Bear, Stearns &amp; Co. Inc.</p>
<p>PaineWebber Incorporated</p>
<p>Goldman, Sachs &amp; Co.</p>
